{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H5aQyUun2ng1cM1esScpt2","type":"tool_result","content":"100\t  - pkg/sys does not provide file-watching or inotify/kqueue interfaces.\n101\t  - pkg/sys does not handle SIGUSR1/SIGUSR2 (find's debug output); those are deferred to the find SRD.\n102\t  - pkg/sys does not provide process-group or terminal control (TIOCGPGRP, tcsetpgrp); those are deferred to the xargs SRD.\n103\t\n104\tpackage_contract:\n105\t  exports:\n106\t    - name: FileInfo\n107\t      signature: \"type FileInfo struct { Mode os.FileMode; Size int64; Nlink uint64; Uid uint32; Gid uint32; Rdev uint64; Dev uint64; Ino uint64; Blocks int64; Blksize int64; ModTime time.Time; AccessTime time.Time; ChangeTime time.Time; Info os.FileInfo }\"\n108\t    - name: Stat\n109\t      signature: \"func Stat(path string) (*FileInfo, error)\"\n110\t    - name: Lstat\n111\t      signature: \"func Lstat(path string) (*FileInfo, error)\"\n112\t    - name: TerminalWidth\n113\t      signature: \"func TerminalWidth() (int, error)\"\n114\t    - name: IsTerminal\n115\t      signature: \"func IsTerminal(fd uintptr) bool\"\n116\t    - name: InstallSIGPIPEHandler\n117\t      signature: \"func InstallSIGPIPEHandler()\"\n118\t    - name: OnTerminalResize\n119\t      signature: \"func OnTerminalResize(callback func(width int))\"\n120\t  imports:\n121\t    - os\n122\t    - os/signal\n123\t    - syscall\n124\t    - time\n125\t    - golang.org/x/sys/unix\n126\t  import_constraints:\n127\t    - \"Must not import any cmd/ package.\"\n128\t    - \"Must not import any other pkg/ package.\"\n129\t\n130\tacceptance_criteria:\n131\t  - id: AC1\n132\t    criterion: \"TerminalWidth() returns a positive integer when called in a test with a pseudo-terminal (golang.org/x/term's test helpers or os.Pipe() as a TTY substitute is acceptable).\"\n133\t    traces:\n134\t      - R1.1\n135\t      - R1.2\n136\t      - R1.3\n137\t      - R1.4\n138\t      - R1.5\n139\t      - R1.6\n140\t      - R1.7\n141\t  - id: AC2\n142\t    criterion: \"Stat() and Lstat() on a known file return FileInfo with correct Nlink, Uid, Gid, Dev, Ino, and Blocks values as confirmed by running stat(1) on the same file.\"\n143\t    traces:\n144\t      - R1.1\n145\t      - R1.2\n146\t      - R1.3\n147\t      - R1.4\n148\t      - R1.5\n149\t      - R1.6\n150\t      - R1.7\n151\t  - id: AC3\n152\t    criterion: \"Lstat() on a symlink returns the symlink's own st_mode (type bits show symlink), not the target's mode.\"\n153\t    traces:\n154\t      - R1.1\n155\t      - R1.2\n156\t      - R1.3\n157\t      - R1.4\n158\t      - R1.5\n159\t      - R1.6\n160\t      - R1.7\n161\t  - id: AC4\n162\t    criterion: \"InstallSIGPIPEHandler() causes a process writing to a broken pipe to exit 0 rather than printing a write error.\"\n163\t    traces:\n164\t      - R1.1\n165\t      - R1.5\n166\t      - R1.7\n167\t      - R2.1\n168\t      - R3.1\n169\t  - id: AC5\n170\t    criterion: \"All pkg/sys code compiles on both darwin/arm64 and linux/amd64 with no build errors and no cgo.\"\n171\t    traces:\n172\t      - R1.1\n173\t      - R1.5\n174\t      - R1.7\n175\t      - R2.1\n176\t      - R3.1\n177\t  - id: AC6\n178\t    criterion: \"All pkg/sys code compiles with no warnings under golangci-lint.\"\n179\t    traces:\n180\t      - R1.1\n181\t      - R1.2\n182\t      - R1.3\n183\t      - R1.4\n184\t      - R1.5\n185\t      - R1.6\n186\t      - R1.7\n187\t      - R2.1\n188\t      - R2.2\n189\t      - R2.3\n190\t      - R2.4\n191\t      - R2.5\n192\t      - R2.6\n193\t      - R3.1\n194\t      - R3.2\n195\t      - R3.3\n196\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e3ffaf6-cb8a-47c8-89e3-510894fff4bc","uuid":"cef671ae-4f3f-48dd-8dd7-95d34c2413e8","timestamp":"2026-05-13T21:29:33.922Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5064/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd002-sys.yaml","content":"  - p